# Comparar Métricas de Perfis

## Row {height=30%}

```{r}
#| content: sidebar
#| title: Configurações

div (
  class = "airfoil-filters",

  selectInput(
    "filter_metric",
    "Métrica:",
    choices = c(
      "Cl x Alfa" = "cl_alpha",
      "Cd x Alfa" = "cd_alpha",
      "(Cd/Cl) Alfa" = "clcd_alpha"
    )
  ),
  
  selectInput(
    "filter_axis_x",
    "Eixo X:",
    choices = c(
      "Alfa (Ângulo de Ataque)" = "alpha"
    )
  ),
  
  checkboxGroupInput( 
    "filter_airfoil", 
    "Visualizar Perfis:", 
    c( 
      "Asa" = "airfoil_wing",
      "Empenagem (Horizontal)" = "airfoil_horizontal_stabilizer", 
      "Empenagem (Vertical)" = "airfoil_vertical_stabilizer" 
    ) 
  )
)
```

